!Sample_data_processing = Counting: Trimmed 20bp reads were counted by exact matches with the sgRNA library sequences.
!Sample_data_processing = Normalization: Raw reads were intra-sample normalized with edgeR function cpm.
!Sample_data_processing = Differential analysis: First, log2 fold-changes based on CPM values between different valine conditions and repsective treatment days were calculated with a pseudocount of 0.1.
!Sample_data_processing = Gene summary: To summarize individual sgRNAs on a gene-level, we executed the R-package "ceres" to report essentiality scores per gene, using log2 fold-changes..
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: hg19
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: tsv file - per-sample CPM and differential CERES scores
